From caf-talk Caf Mar 23 07:59:23 1994
From: weave@hopi.dtcc.edu (Ken Weaverling)
Newsgroups: alt.homosexual,alt.comp.acad-freedom.talk
Subject: Re: Should censor wannabe be censored now?
