       already decided not to provide alt.sex, but you would like to
       provide newsgroup news.answers. The only problem is that the
       alt.sex FAQ (Frequently Asked Questions) file, like many other
       FAQ's is periodically posted to newsgroup news.answers. Should you
       filter out the alt.sex FAQ from news.answers before passing it on?
       
